\date{2026-10-31T05:26:11Z}
\title{Subobject equivalence relation}
\taxon{Definition}
\author{hsuchingchung}
\import{macros-subobj}

\p{
Two [monomorphisms](0006) #{u, v} into the same object #{A} in a category \CCat are considered \strong{equivalent} if ##{u \le v \text{ and } v \le u,} denoted by #{u \sim v}. Recall that #{u \le v} denotes the [subobject inclusion relation](0008).}
